# Recorded sessions. These are raw IMU captures of a real subject's heart and
# breathing -- they belong to whoever was wearing the device, not to the repo.
# They are also large and reproducible: anyone can make their own with
# tools/serve.sh. tools/gate_check.mjs reads whatever is present here.
data/

# Firmware build output: 5 MB of .elf/.map/.hex regenerated by tools/flash.sh.
build/

